==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Knuckles (Enemy)|Knuckles]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The peons on this stage prove little to no threat, but if you are having issues with them, use Cats like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to deal with them. As the previous stages, this stage is easy, so you shouldn't have many problems.

